<main class="dashboard">
  <header class="dashboard__header"><h1>GitHub access needs setup</h1><a href="/workspaces">All workspaces</a></header>
  <section class="error-panel" role="alert">
    <h2>Checkout couldn't authenticate</h2>
    <p>The server needs Git credentials to fetch this repository. GitHub CLI access alone may not configure Git.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="status-panel" aria-labelledby="fix-heading">
    <h2 id="fix-heading">Fix on the server</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open a terminal in the app container, as the user running Workspaces.</li>
      <li>Check GitHub CLI authentication: <code>gh auth status</code>. If needed, authenticate with <code>gh auth login</code>.</li>
      <li>Connect Git to those credentials:</li>
    </ol>
    <pre><code>gh auth setup-git --hostname github.com</code></pre>
    <p>For SSH remotes, configure a key authorized for the repository instead. Persist the credential setup in the container configuration.</p>
    <% if @retry_path %>
      <form method="post" action="<%= escape(@retry_path) %>"><button class="button button--primary">Retry checkout</button></form>
    <% else %>
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/workspaces">Back to workspace creation</a>
    <% end %>
  </section>
</main>
